      Version=1.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null
  m_text: "Put in hub in safe mode. \nDoing this will execute following tasks.\\n\\n1.<indent=5%>Apply
    rotor lock</indent>\\n2.<indent=5%>Turn Hub access switch to Service Mode</indent>\\n3.<indent=5%>Wait
    for the flashing orange light to turn solid</indent>\\n4.<indent=5%>Close the
    Pitch Block Ball Valves</indent>\\n5.<indent=5%>Check for a solid green light
    on the Hub Controller Cabinet</indent>\\n6.<indent=5%>Confirm Hub Safe Active
    \u2013 HMI 11.99A</indent>\\n<indent=5%>The text on this screen will need to say
    True, True, Active</indent>"
